{"type":"message","id":"306805c7","parentId":"df9a4449","timestamp":"2026-07-06T22:42:05.706Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"iuzVBB98","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"2026년 7월 7일 경제 주요 이슈 심층 분석 삼성전자 실적 환율 부동산 청년주택 이슈\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 750,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ec1bc8caf8ec6356\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n7.6[월] 한국증시 트렌드 진단 - 네이버 프리미엄콘텐츠\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ec1bc8caf8ec6356\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://contents.premium.naver.com/ifstudiolab/ifstudiolaboratory/contents/260706182222464yi\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"28a32b49756d1e7e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n자료 기준일은 2026년 7월 6일이며, 이번 진단의 핵심은 “<strong>상승 추세는 유지되지만, 환율·금리·수급 부담 때문에 추격보다 지지 확인이 우선</strong>”입니다.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"28a32b49756d1e7e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"20 hours ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"contents.premium.naver.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bf500d694a30b97b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEconomic Calendar - Investing.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bf500d694a30b97b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.investing.com/economic-calendar\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a4a793d5936570e4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEconomic calendar: get indicators in real-time as economic events are announced and see the immediate global market impact - Including previous, forecast and actual figures.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a4a793d5936570e4\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"June 3, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.investing.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\"